New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:6.34pt"&gt;The weighted-average remaining lives of the 2014, 2017, 2020, 2021, April 2022, December 2022, and 2025 Notes were 14.4, 15.4, 18.1, 13.2, 13.8, 4.4, and 15.6 years as of December&#160;31, 2025. The combined weighted-average remaining life of the Notes was 14.1 years as of December&#160;31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:ScheduleOfDebtInstrumentsTextBlock>
