    <ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock contextRef="c-360" id="f-1583">&lt;div style="margin-top:5pt;text-indent:24.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;On November 3, 2025, David A. Zapolsky, Senior Vice President, Chief Global Affairs and Legal Officer, adopted a trading plan intended to satisfy Rule 10b5-1(c) to sell up to 64,059 shares of Amazon.com, Inc. common stock over a period ending on November 30, 2026, subject to certain conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock>
