    <ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock contextRef="c-368" id="f-1611">&lt;div style="margin-top:5pt;text-indent:24.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;On November 14, 2025, Andrew R. Jassy, President and Chief Executive Officer, adopted a trading plan intended to satisfy Rule 10b5-1(c) to sell up to 142,224 shares of Amazon.com, Inc. common stock over a period ending on December 31, 2026, subject to certain conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock>
