    <ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock contextRef="c-372" id="f-1625">&lt;div style="margin-top:5pt;text-indent:24.75pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;On November 19, 2025, Brian T. Olsavsky, Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer, terminated a trading plan intended to satisfy Rule 10b5-1(c) initially adopted on May 20, 2025 to sell up to 53,249 shares of Amazon.com, Inc. common stock over a period ending on March 2, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock>
